# G1: the EXACTNESS arm, after the five W1 completions. c2-packed-tp4-warm4-gate is c2-packed-tp4-gate (every verify audit ON) plus QWEN_FAST_M3_REQUEST_WARM=1 and nothing else. The T1 audit re-records the
# pinned sampler in the packed trace, so this arm proves exactness with the warm, not hang safety: no audited arm can be free of the in-trace sampler. The matrix runs four users at 4,096 / 16,384 / 32,768 /
# 60,000 prompt tokens, 512 out, every user's text against the same user alone.
# Read: POLICY PASS and every user identical to solo; no audit mismatch line; the warm line comes before the packed_verify engaged line (read by hand: the gate path does not run c2_smoke_check).
# A G1 failure skips the timing. Duration (estimate): 60-120 min.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the four-card tp4/warm4 window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/warm4 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or
# a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The window's jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-warm4a is a PLACEHOLDER for ONE FRESH tag, built by B0 from the pushed tp4/warm4 commit; the driver
# substitutes it in every template once the image is built. A later commit needs a new tag.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset gate
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-warm4a
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-warm4-gate
C2_GATE_PLAN=matrix
C2_GATE_LENGTHS=4096,16384,32768,60000
C2_GATE_MAX_TOKENS=512
C2_GATE_JIT=record
